{"seq":2,"slug":"logical-connectives","title":"高一数学 — 逻辑联结词","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic/logical-connectives","wordCount":1580,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一数学-逻辑联结词\">高一数学 — 逻辑联结词</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>逻辑联结词是将简单命题组合成复合命题的连接词，是数学推理和证明的基础工具。高一阶段需要掌握三种基本逻辑联结词：&quot;且&quot;（∧，and）、&quot;或&quot;（∨，or）、&quot;非&quot;（¬，not），以及它们对命题真假性的影响规则。</p>\n<p>同时需要理解命题的概念（可以判断真假的陈述句）、命题的否定与否命题的区别、含有量词的命题（全称命题和特称命题）及其否定规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-命题的基本概念\">一、命题的基本概念</h3><p>命题是可以判断真假的陈述句。&quot;2是偶数&quot;是命题（真命题），&quot;x &gt; 3&quot;不是命题（含未知数，真假不确定），&quot;请打开窗户&quot;不是命题（祈使句，不是陈述句）。</p>\n<p>命题通常用小写字母p、q、r等表示。如：p：&quot;π是无理数&quot;（真命题），q：&quot;3 &gt; 5&quot;（假命题）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-三种逻辑联结词\">二、三种逻辑联结词</h3><p><strong>&quot;且&quot;（∧）</strong>：用&quot;且&quot;联结两个命题p和q，得到复合命题&quot;p∧q&quot;（读作&quot;p且q&quot;）。其含义是p和q同时成立。</p>\n<p>真值表：p∧q为真，当且仅当p和q都为真。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>p</th>\n<th>q</th>\n<th>p∧q</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>假</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>假</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>假</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>例如：p：&quot;2是偶数&quot;（真），q：&quot;3是奇数&quot;（真），则p∧q：&quot;2是偶数且3是奇数&quot;为真。</p>\n<p><strong>&quot;或&quot;（∨）</strong>：用&quot;或&quot;联结两个命题p和q，得到复合命题&quot;p∨q&quot;（读作&quot;p或q&quot;）。其含义是p和q至少有一个成立。注意数学中的&quot;或&quot;是&quot;可兼或&quot;，即p和q可以同时成立。</p>\n<p>真值表：p∨q为假，当且仅当p和q都为假。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>p</th>\n<th>q</th>\n<th>p∨q</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>假</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>&quot;非&quot;（¬）</strong>：对命题p取否定，得到命题&quot;¬p&quot;（读作&quot;非p&quot;）。其含义是&quot;p不成立&quot;。</p>\n<p>真值表：¬p的真假与p相反。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>p</th>\n<th>¬p</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真</td>\n<td>假</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假</td>\n<td>真</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-含有量词的命题\">三、含有量词的命题</h3><p><strong>全称量词</strong>：&quot;对所有的&quot;&quot;对任意的&quot;，符号∀。全称命题的形式：∀x∈M, p(x)。</p>\n<p>例如：&quot;对所有的正整数n，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ≥ n&quot;即∀n∈ℕ*, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ≥ n（真命题）。</p>\n<p><strong>存在量词</strong>：&quot;存在一个&quot;&quot;至少有一个&quot;，符号∃。特称命题的形式：∃x∈M, p(x)。</p>\n<p>例如：&quot;存在实数x，使得<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 1 = 0&quot;即∃x∈ℝ, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 1 = 0（假命题）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-命题的否定规则\">四、命题的否定规则</h3><p><strong>简单命题的否定</strong>：直接否定谓词。&quot;x &gt; 3&quot;的否定是&quot;x ≤ 3&quot;，&quot;a是偶数&quot;的否定是&quot;a不是偶数&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>复合命题的否定</strong>：</p>\n<p>¬(p∧q) = (¬p)∨(¬q) —— &quot;不是p且q&quot;等价于&quot;非p或非q&quot;</p>\n<p>¬(p∨q) = (¬p)∧(¬q) —— &quot;不是p或q&quot;等价于&quot;非p且非q&quot;</p>\n<p>¬(¬p) = p —— 双重否定等于肯定</p>\n<p><strong>含量词命题的否定</strong>：</p>\n<p>¬(∀x∈M, p(x)) = ∃x∈M, ¬p(x) —— 全称命题的否定是特称命题</p>\n<p>¬(∃x∈M, p(x)) = ∀x∈M, ¬p(x) —— 特称命题的否定是全称命题</p>\n<p>例如：&quot;所有的偶数都能被2整除&quot;的否定是&quot;存在某个偶数不能被2整除&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-命题的否定与否命题的区别\">五、命题的否定与否命题的区别</h3><p>这是高一学生容易混淆的重点：</p>\n<p><strong>命题的否定</strong>（否定命题的结论）：原命题&quot;若p则q&quot;，其否定是&quot;若p则¬q&quot;（条件不变，结论取反）。</p>\n<p><strong>否命题</strong>（同时否定条件和结论）：原命题&quot;若p则q&quot;，其否命题是&quot;若¬p则¬q&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原命题</td>\n<td>若p则q</td>\n<td>若x&gt;0，则<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&gt;0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>否命题</td>\n<td>若¬p则¬q</td>\n<td>若x≤0，则<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>≤0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆命题</td>\n<td>若q则p</td>\n<td>若<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&gt;0，则x&gt;0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆否命题</td>\n<td>若¬q则¬p</td>\n<td>若<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>≤0，则x≤0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>重要定理：原命题与逆否命题等价，否命题与逆命题等价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-典型例题\">六、典型例题</h3><p><strong>例1</strong>：写出命题&quot;∀x∈ℝ, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 2x + 2 &gt; 0&quot;的否定。</p>\n<p>解：∃x∈ℝ, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 2x + 2 ≤ 0。</p>\n<p><strong>例2</strong>：已知p：&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - x - 2 &gt; 0&quot;，q：&quot;x &gt; 2&quot;，判断p∧q、p∨q的真假（当x = 3时）。</p>\n<p>解：当x = 3时，p：9 - 3 - 2 = 4 &gt; 0，为真；q：3 &gt; 2，为真。故p∧q为真，p∨q为真。</p>\n<p><strong>例3</strong>：用逻辑联结词改写：&quot;方程<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 1 = 0没有实数根&quot;。</p>\n<p>解：¬(∃x∈ℝ, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 1 = 0)，即∀x∈ℝ, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 1 ≠ 0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>分别写出下列命题的否定：(1) 所有的质数都是奇数；(2) 存在一个三角形，其内角和不等于180°；(3) 对任意x∈ℝ, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - x ≥ 0。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设p：&quot;△ABC是等边三角形&quot;，q：&quot;△ABC是等腰三角形&quot;，判断p∧q、p∨q、¬p的真假。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>写出命题&quot;若a &gt; 0且b &gt; 0，则a + b &gt; 0&quot;的逆命题、否命题和逆否命题，并分别判断真假。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：日常生活中的&quot;或&quot;与数学中的&quot;或&quot;有什么区别？举例说明。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>逻辑学是数学与哲学的交叉领域。推荐阅读《逻辑的力量》了解命题逻辑在日常推理中的应用。布尔代数是将逻辑运算代数化的数学分支，是现代计算机科学的理论基础——计算机中的与门（AND）、或门（OR）、非门（NOT）正对应于数学中的三种逻辑联结词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"set-theory\">集合论</a> —— &quot;且&quot;对应集合的交、&quot;或&quot;对应集合的并、&quot;非&quot;对应补集，逻辑联结词与集合运算是同一结构的两种语言。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"sufficient-necessary\">充分必要条件</a> —— 命题之间的推出关系（p⇒q）建立在对复合命题真假的判断之上，逻辑联结词是表达条件命题的工具。</li>\n<li>跨学科（哲学与逻辑·形式逻辑）：<a href=\"../../../../../philosophy-logic/formal-logic/propositional-calculus/propositions-and-connectives\">命题与联结词</a> 与 <a href=\"../../../../../philosophy-logic/formal-logic/propositional-calculus/truth-tables-and-tautology\">真值表与重言式</a> —— 命题逻辑的严格形式化展开，把高中的真值表方法推进到重言式、推理规则与完备性。</li>\n<li>跨学科（计算机基础·数字逻辑）：<a href=\"../../../../../cs-fundamentals/digital-logic/boolean-algebra/boolean-operations\">布尔运算</a> 与 <a href=\"../../../../../cs-fundamentals/digital-logic/logic-gates/basic-gates\">基本逻辑门</a> —— 与门、或门、非门正是&quot;且、或、非&quot;三种联结词的物理实现，是现代计算机的逻辑基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>逻辑联结词是数学推理的基本工具。&quot;且&quot;要求两个条件同时满足，&quot;或&quot;要求至少满足一个，&quot;非&quot;将命题的真假颠倒。掌握复合命题的真值判断规则和含量词命题的否定方法，是进行严密数学推理的前提。特别注意命题的否定与否命题的区别——前者只否定结论，后者同时否定条件和结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一数学 — 逻辑联结词","id":"高一数学-逻辑联结词"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、命题的基本概念","id":"一-命题的基本概念"},{"level":3,"text":"二、三种逻辑联结词","id":"二-三种逻辑联结词"},{"level":3,"text":"三、含有量词的命题","id":"三-含有量词的命题"},{"level":3,"text":"四、命题的否定规则","id":"四-命题的否定规则"},{"level":3,"text":"五、命题的否定与否命题的区别","id":"五-命题的否定与否命题的区别"},{"level":3,"text":"六、典型例题","id":"六-典型例题"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一数学 — 集合论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic/set-theory"},"next":{"title":"高一数学 — 充分必要条件","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic/sufficient-necessary"}}